# VSIX → Zed

- Prefer Vsix2Zed MCP (`analyze_vsix` → `convert_vsix`) before hand-editing.
- Zed does not run VS Code extension host JS.
- Packaged files are allowlisted; sidecars go in `extensions/work/<id>` at runtime.
- Use REA MCP (`rea`) for opaque binaries/bundles; remake for Zed, don't transpile `vscode.*`.
- Official docs: https://zed.dev/docs/extensions/developing-extensions
